                        <span id="Span3"><span style="background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">All this because we want you to be absolutely, completely and totally happy about what you buy.</span></span>
